#### GM Channel (Message Mode)
```json
{
    "gm": {
        "id": "1234567890",
        "interval": 360,
        "message": "Good morning!"
    }
}
```
- Sends fixed message at intervals
- No AI processing
- Simple greeting/announcement

#### Custom Channel
```json
{
    "custom-chat": {
        "id": "1122334455",
        "interval": 15,
        "useAI": true
    }
}
```
- Your custom configuration
- Choose AI or message mode
- Flexible naming

